WEBVTT

00:00:07.808 --> 00:00:09.168
(BABBLING)

00:00:12.528 --> 00:00:14.528
EDNA: I understand
your lack of sleep

00:00:14.608 --> 00:00:15.848
and coherency, Robert.

00:00:16.008 --> 00:00:17.448
Babies can be anything,

00:00:17.528 --> 00:00:19.048
and your child
is no exception.

00:00:19.248 --> 00:00:21.928
He has pure,
unlimited potential, Robert.

00:00:22.128 --> 00:00:25.008
He slept while I worked
in a creative fever.

00:00:25.208 --> 00:00:27.648
Auntie Edna stayed up
all night...

00:00:27.808 --> 00:00:30.328
making sure you look fabulous
in your many forms.

00:00:30.488 --> 00:00:32.848
What are you...
You're putting him in the...

00:00:33.008 --> 00:00:34.208
In the chamber, Robert.

00:00:34.368 --> 00:00:35.968
He is part
of the demonstration

00:00:36.048 --> 00:00:37.088
and will be fine.

00:00:37.248 --> 00:00:39.168
Your challenge
is to manage a baby

00:00:39.248 --> 00:00:40.768
who has multiple powers...

00:00:40.928 --> 00:00:43.288
and no control over them, yes?

00:00:44.128 --> 00:00:45.488
Huh. That sums it up.

00:00:45.688 --> 00:00:47.088
I often work to music

00:00:47.168 --> 00:00:49.928
and I noticed the baby
responds to it as well.

00:00:50.088 --> 00:00:51.968
Specifically, Mozart.

00:00:52.048 --> 00:00:53.768
-(CLASSICAL MUSIC PLAYING)
-I blended Kevlar

00:00:53.848 --> 00:00:55.688
with carbyne
for durability under duress...

00:00:55.848 --> 00:00:57.768
and cotton for comfort.

00:00:57.928 --> 00:01:01.048
Interwoven with these fabrics
are a mesh of tiny sensors...

00:01:01.248 --> 00:01:04.208
that monitor the baby's
physical properties.

00:01:04.368 --> 00:01:07.248
Oh, Lord! (STAMMERS)
What is he doing?

00:01:07.408 --> 00:01:10.328
Well, it's Mozart, Robert.
Can you blame him?

00:01:10.488 --> 00:01:12.568
The important thing is that
the suit and tracker...

00:01:12.728 --> 00:01:14.688
anticipated the change
and alerted you.

00:01:14.848 --> 00:01:17.408
Oh, no. Cookies.
I gotta get cookies!

00:01:17.568 --> 00:01:19.368
You do not need cookies.

00:01:19.528 --> 00:01:21.808
As I learned quite painfully
last night...

00:01:21.968 --> 00:01:23.768
any solution involving cookies

00:01:23.848 --> 00:01:26.608
will inevitably result
in the demon baby.

00:01:26.688 --> 00:01:27.688
(GROWLING)

00:01:28.528 --> 00:01:29.888
"Combustion imminent"?

00:01:30.048 --> 00:01:32.168
What does that mean? (YELPS)

00:01:32.248 --> 00:01:33.848
It means fire, Robert,

00:01:33.928 --> 00:01:36.088
for which the suit
has countermeasures.

00:01:36.248 --> 00:01:38.968
I suggest you extinguish
the baby's flames

00:01:39.048 --> 00:01:40.968
before he trips
the sprinkler system.

00:01:43.088 --> 00:01:44.768
-(BOB EXHALES)
-The flame retardant

00:01:44.848 --> 00:01:47.008
is blackberry lavender,
darling.

00:01:47.208 --> 00:01:49.848
Effective, edible,
and delicious.

00:01:50.048 --> 00:01:53.288
Well, what do you know?
That is useful.

00:01:53.448 --> 00:01:56.208
Although, I have doubtlessly
exceeded your expectations

00:01:56.288 --> 00:01:58.128
for a single night's work...

00:01:58.288 --> 00:01:59.608
the suit and device contain

00:01:59.688 --> 00:02:01.648
a few more features
we need to discuss.

00:02:01.848 --> 00:02:04.368
Thanks again, E,
for everything.

00:02:04.448 --> 00:02:05.848
How much do I owe you for...

00:02:06.008 --> 00:02:08.848
Pish-posh, darling. Your bill
will be covered by my fee...

00:02:09.008 --> 00:02:11.088
for being Mr. Incredible,
Elastigirl,

00:02:11.168 --> 00:02:13.648
and Frozone's
exclusive designer...

00:02:13.808 --> 00:02:16.088
throughout the known universe
and until the end of time.

00:02:16.248 --> 00:02:18.128
But babysitting this one...

00:02:18.288 --> 00:02:21.088
I do for free, darling.

00:02:33.008 --> 00:02:34.088
(GASPS)

00:02:36.368 --> 00:02:37.488
(GRUNTS)

00:02:37.568 --> 00:02:38.688
(STRAINING)

00:02:38.768 --> 00:02:39.888
EVELYN: (ON SPEAKERS)
I would resist

00:02:39.968 --> 00:02:41.208
the temptation to stretch.

00:02:41.368 --> 00:02:44.408
The temperature around you
is well below freezing.

00:02:44.568 --> 00:02:47.088
Try to stretch
and you'll break.

00:02:47.248 --> 00:02:49.768
So, you're the Screenslaver.

00:02:49.928 --> 00:02:52.288
Yes and no.

00:02:52.448 --> 00:02:55.048
Let's say,
I created the character

00:02:55.128 --> 00:02:56.848
and pre-recorded the messages.

00:02:57.008 --> 00:02:58.368
-Does Winston know?
-(SCOFFS)

00:02:58.568 --> 00:03:01.328
That I'm the Screenslaver?
Of course not.

00:03:01.488 --> 00:03:03.808
Can you imagine
what Mr. Free Enterprise

00:03:03.888 --> 00:03:05.688
would do
with my hypnosis technology?

00:03:05.848 --> 00:03:07.168
Worse than what you're doing?

00:03:07.328 --> 00:03:09.448
Hey, I'm using the technology

00:03:09.528 --> 00:03:11.008
to destroy
people's trust in it.

00:03:11.288 --> 00:03:13.528
Like I'm using superheroes.

00:03:13.688 --> 00:03:15.128
Who did I put in jail?

00:03:15.288 --> 00:03:16.608
Pizza delivery guy.

00:03:16.688 --> 00:03:18.208
Seemed the right height,
build.

00:03:18.368 --> 00:03:20.408
He gave you
a pretty good fight.

00:03:20.568 --> 00:03:22.168
I should say I gave you

00:03:22.248 --> 00:03:23.608
a pretty good fight
through him.

00:03:23.808 --> 00:03:25.368
(SHIVERING) But it doesn't
bother you

00:03:25.448 --> 00:03:27.048
that an innocent man
is in jail?

00:03:27.288 --> 00:03:30.328
Eh, he was surly
and the pizza was cold.

00:03:30.408 --> 00:03:31.888
I counted on you.

00:03:32.248 --> 00:03:33.488
That's why you failed.

00:03:33.688 --> 00:03:34.768
What?

00:03:34.928 --> 00:03:37.888
Why would you count on me?
Because I built you a bike?

00:03:38.048 --> 00:03:40.208
Because my brother
knows the words

00:03:40.288 --> 00:03:41.328
to your theme song?

00:03:41.488 --> 00:03:42.888
We don't know each other.

00:03:43.048 --> 00:03:44.808
But you can
count on me anyway.

00:03:44.968 --> 00:03:46.448
I am supposed to, aren't I?

00:03:46.608 --> 00:03:48.888
Because you have
some strange abilities

00:03:48.968 --> 00:03:50.128
and a shiny costume...

00:03:50.328 --> 00:03:52.688
the rest of us are supposed
to put our lives

00:03:52.768 --> 00:03:54.648
into your gloved hands.

00:03:54.808 --> 00:03:57.208
That's what
my father believed.

00:03:57.368 --> 00:04:00.848
When our home was broken into,
my mother wanted to hide.

00:04:01.008 --> 00:04:03.288
Begged my father
to use the safe room.

00:04:03.448 --> 00:04:07.648
But Father insisted they call
his superhero friends.

00:04:07.848 --> 00:04:12.208
He died,
pointlessly, stupidly...

00:04:12.808 --> 00:04:15.128
waiting for heroes
to save the day.

00:04:15.288 --> 00:04:16.808
But why would you...

00:04:16.888 --> 00:04:18.128
-Your brother...
-Is a child!

00:04:18.968 --> 00:04:20.608
He remembers the time

00:04:20.688 --> 00:04:22.728
when we had parents
and superheroes.

00:04:22.888 --> 00:04:26.648
So, like a child,
Winston conflates the two.

00:04:26.808 --> 00:04:30.288
Mommy and Daddy went away
because supers went away.

00:04:30.448 --> 00:04:33.008
Our sweet parents were fools

00:04:33.088 --> 00:04:34.928
to put their lives
in anybody else's hands.

00:04:35.248 --> 00:04:37.288
Superheroes keep us weak.

00:04:38.128 --> 00:04:39.768
Are you gonna kill me?

00:04:40.528 --> 00:04:41.528
Nah.

00:04:43.568 --> 00:04:44.928
Using you is better.

00:04:45.088 --> 00:04:47.968
You're gonna help me make
supers illegal...

00:04:48.128 --> 00:04:49.568
forever.

00:04:50.528 --> 00:04:52.048
(GRUNTING)

00:04:54.608 --> 00:04:56.088
Dada. Dada.

00:04:57.128 --> 00:04:59.168
Ready?
Laser eyes.

00:05:00.808 --> 00:05:01.808
Stop.

00:05:01.888 --> 00:05:02.888
-Wow!
-Yeah!

00:05:02.968 --> 00:05:04.608
-Yay, Jack-Jack!
-Yeah, baby!

00:05:04.688 --> 00:05:05.688
And that's not all.
Watch this.

00:05:05.848 --> 00:05:07.568
Jack-Jack, blaster ready?

00:05:09.088 --> 00:05:10.728
(IMITATES BLASTER FIRING)

00:05:12.408 --> 00:05:14.488
-DASH: No way.
-That is crazy cool.

00:05:14.568 --> 00:05:15.608
My turn.
I get to blast him first!

00:05:15.768 --> 00:05:16.768
Let me try. I want him.
Give him to me.

00:05:16.848 --> 00:05:18.168
Hey, I'm just demonstrating.

00:05:18.248 --> 00:05:20.608
No firing the baby around
the house, you understand?

00:05:20.768 --> 00:05:23.328
This is potentially
dangerous...

00:05:23.488 --> 00:05:26.288
and we're trying to teach him
to control his powers, okay?

00:05:26.448 --> 00:05:28.008
-(BEEPING)
-Stop. See the screen.

00:05:30.248 --> 00:05:32.608
He vanished!
That's really cool!

00:05:32.728 --> 00:05:33.728
(JACK-JACK BABBLING
FROM OTHER DIMENSION)

00:05:33.808 --> 00:05:34.888
Okay, good. Use the thing.

00:05:34.968 --> 00:05:37.048
That's the current readout.
Click it. See the readout?

00:05:37.208 --> 00:05:39.008
Dimension four. See the shape?

00:05:39.168 --> 00:05:40.928
That's the room.
See where he is in relation?

00:05:41.088 --> 00:05:42.088
So, where is he?

00:05:43.768 --> 00:05:45.088
He's... there!

00:05:46.288 --> 00:05:48.128
Okay. Come out.
Num-num cookie?

00:05:50.128 --> 00:05:51.528
-Yay, Jack-Jack!
-Yeah, Jack-Jack!

00:05:51.688 --> 00:05:53.368
-That's really cool.
-(ALARM BEEPING)

